---
// Visual guide to reading Flat vs Cumulative (Cum) in Top tables and Flame Graph plateaus.
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="ge7b">
  <div class="ge7b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing Flat (direct work inside a function) versus Cumulative (total work including child calls) across a pprof call stack and Flame Graph.">
      {/* Left: Flat vs Cum table */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="420" height="258" rx="10" class="ge7b-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge7b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Flat vs. Cumulative (Cum) in pprof Top</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Phân biệt Flat (tự chạy) và Cum (cả hàm con)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="388" height="46" rx="6" class="ge7b-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="ge7b-b">HandleRequest()  — Flat: 5%  |  Cum: 100%</text>
      <text x="44" y="96" class="ge7b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Orchestrates children; waits for Parse &amp; ParseInt</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ điều phối, phần lớn thời gian nằm trong hàm con</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="118" width="388" height="46" rx="6" class="ge7b-box" />
      <text x="44" y="138" class="ge7b-b">ParseLines()     — Flat: 15% |  Cum: 95%</text>
      <text x="44" y="154" class="ge7b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Loops lines; spends 80% inside bytes.Split / ParseInt</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chạy vòng lặp; đẩy 80% việc cho bytes.Split / ParseInt</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="176" width="388" height="48" rx="6" class="ge7b-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="196" class="ge7b-b-red">bytes.genSplit() — Flat: 80% |  Cum: 80%</text>
      <text x="44" y="213" class="ge7b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Leaf bottleneck! High Flat = optimize or bypass this call.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nút thắt gốc! Flat cao = tự nó đốt tài nguyên trực tiếp.</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="30" y="248" class="ge7b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Note: Sum% walks rows top-down until 80% Pareto bottleneck is clear.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mẹo: nhìn cột Sum% cộng dồn tới 80% là thấy ngay thủ phạm chính.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Flamegraph plateau anatomy */}
      <rect x="452" y="14" width="434" height="258" rx="10" class="ge7b-card" />
      <text x="468" y="42" class="ge7b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. How to read a Flame Graph (width = %, NOT time!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Đọc Flame Graph (chiều rộng = tỷ lệ %, KHÔNG phải trục giờ)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Icicle/Flame stack bars */}
      <rect x="468" y="64" width="402" height="32" rx="4" class="ge7b-bar-root" />
      <text x="480" y="84" class="ge7b-b">root: main / testing.B.launch (Cum: 100%)</text>

      <rect x="468" y="100" width="382" height="32" rx="4" class="ge7b-bar-mid" />
      <text x="480" y="120" class="ge7b-b">HandleRequest() — thin exposed edge (Flat: 5%)</text>

      <rect x="468" y="136" width="360" height="32" rx="4" class="ge7b-bar-mid" />
      <text x="480" y="156" class="ge7b-b">ParseLines() — passes 80% below (Flat: 15%)</text>

      <rect x="468" y="172" width="302" height="32" rx="4" class="ge7b-bar-hot" />
      <text x="480" y="192" class="ge7b-b-red">bytes.genSplit() — Wide Plateau! (Flat: 80%)</text>

      <rect x="774" y="172" width="54" height="32" rx="4" class="ge7b-bar-cold" />
      <text x="781" y="192" class="ge7b-m">I/O</text>

      <rect x="468" y="218" width="402" height="40" rx="6" class="ge7b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="480" y="236" class="ge7b-b-ok">Look for wide flat plateaus, not tall narrow towers:</text>
      <text x="480" y="251" class="ge7b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Bars are sorted alphabetically left-to-right; width = Cum%.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xếp theo A–Z từ trái sang; thanh nào đỉnh rộng mới là chỗ cần sửa.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In a Flame Graph, the X-axis does NOT show chronological time—it shows alphabetical width proportional to total samples. Wide exposed rooftops reveal high Flat time you can directly cut.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trong Flame Graph, trục ngang KHÔNG phải dòng thời gian — nó xếp theo chữ cái để thể hiện tỷ lệ %. Những phần đỉnh rộng nhô ra (Flat cao) chính là chỗ trực tiếp đốt CPU hay RAM.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge7b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge7b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge7b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge7b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge7b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge7b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge7b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge7b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7b-bar-root { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge7b-bar-mid { fill: var(--bg); stroke: rgb(180, 83, 9); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7b-bar-mid { stroke: rgb(251, 191, 36); }
  .ge7b-bar-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ge7b-bar-cold { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ge7b-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge7b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge7b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
